et_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tomb_of_Nefertiti","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4942"}]},{"name":"group","value_wikitext":"[[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]","value_text":"The Organization\nSuits","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[All Work and No Pay]]\"","value_text":"\"All Work and No Pay\"","links":[{"target_title":"All Work and No Pay","label":"All Work and No Pay","target_id":"huntik:page:3956","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/All_Work_and_No_Pay","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3956"}]},{"name":"gender","value_wikitext":"Male","value_text":"Male","links":[]},{"name":"hair","value_wikitext":"Blonde","value_text":"Blonde","links":[]},{"name":"eyes","value_wikitext":"Brown","value_text":"Brown","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":239}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"This Suit was a part of the archaeological team sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]] under [[Klaus]] to uncover the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. When Klaus' initial forces began to lose, he and [[unnamed Suit 035]] joined as backup. The team of Suits nearly overpowered Dante's team, but they managed to escape. {{source|All Work and No Pay}} He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}","text":"This Suit was a part of the archaeological team sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt under Klaus to uncover the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Klaus' initial forces began to lose, he and unnamed Suit 035 joined as backup. The team of Suits nearly overpowered Dante's team, but they managed to escape. [All Work and No Pay] He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. [The Sceptre Deception]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"This Suit and his team were given desert-based [[Titans]] by [[the Organization]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"This Suit and his team were given desert-based Titans by the Organization."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":""}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 034 is a Suit working with Klaus within in the Organization at the site of the Tomb of Nefertiti in Egypt.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was a part of the archaeological team sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt under Klaus to uncover the Tomb of Nefertiti. When Klaus' initial forces began to lose, he and unnamed Suit 035 joined as backup. The team of Suits nearly overpowered Dante's team, but they managed to escape. [All Work and No Pay] He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nAbilities\n\nThis Suit and his team were given desert-based Titans by the Organization.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Raypulse\n\nBonded Titans","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image  = File:Unnamed Suit 034.png\n| base   = [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first  = \"[[All Work and No Pay]]\"\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Blonde\n| eyes   = Brown\n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 034''' is a [[Suit]] working with [[Klaus]] within in [[the Organization]] at the site of the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]] in Egypt.\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was a part of the archaeological team sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]] under [[Klaus]] to uncover the [[Tomb of Nefertiti]]. When Klaus' initial forces began to lose, he and [[unnamed Suit 035]] joined as backup. The team of Suits nearly overpowered Dante's team, but they managed to escape. {{source|All Work and No Pay}} He and a team of Suits later caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nThis Suit and his team were given desert-based [[Titans]] by [[the Organization]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n===Spells Utilized===\n*[[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n===Bonded Titans===\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Minor characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Minor characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:4942","status":"resolved","target_title":"Tomb of Nefertiti","label":"Tomb of Nefertiti","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tomb_of_Nefertiti","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4942"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3956","status":"resolved","target_title":"All Work and No Pay","label":"All Work and No Pay","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/All_Work_and_No_Pay","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3956"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4942","status":"resolved","target_title":"Tomb of Nefertiti","label":"Tomb of Nefertiti","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tomb_of_Nefertiti","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4942"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:14470","status":"resolved","target_title":"Valley of the Kings, Egypt","label":"Valley of the Kings, Egypt","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Valley_of_the_Kings%2C_Egypt","href":"#/categories?name=Valley%20of%20the%20Kings%2C%20Egypt"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4942","status":"resolved","target_title":"Tomb of Nefertiti","label":"Tomb of Nefertiti","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tomb_of_Nefertiti","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4942"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:18324","status":"resolved","target_title":"unnamed Suit 035","label":"unnamed Suit 035","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/unnamed_Suit_035","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A18324"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2010","status":"resolved","target_title":"Titans","label":"Titans","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Titans","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2010"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2091","status":"resolved","target_title":"Raypulse","label":"Raypulse","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Raypulse","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2091"},{"target_title":"Category:Characters","label":"Category:Characters","target_id":"huntik:page:2021","target_url":"https://huntik.fa